      *>================================================================
      *> PROGRAM-ID : ITMAUDIT
      *> SYSTEM     : STERP - Stefan's ERP
      *> MODULE     : ITEM AND PART MAINTENANCE (STOCK CONTROL)
      *> PURPOSE    : THIN WRAPPER OVER THE COMMON SERVICE AUDITLOG SO
      *>              THAT A STOCK CONTROL PROGRAM NEVER HAS TWO
      *>              STANDARD COMMAREA HEADERS IN SCOPE AT ONCE.  THE
      *>              AUDIT RULES THEMSELVES STAY IN AUDITLOG.
      *> CALLED BY  : SUBSTCHK, ITEMCOPY, ITMIMPCT, COUNTADJ, OPENSTK
      *> INTERFACE  : CALL "ITMAUDIT" USING ITA-BLOCK (COPY ITMAUDTW)
      *> CALLS      : AUDITLOG
      *>----------------------------------------------------------------
      *> CHANGE LOG
      *> 2009-12-01 KMP  CR2310 AUDIT HELPER FOR THE STOCK SUITE
      *> 2026-10-05 STERP REWRITTEN ONTO THE COMMON AUDITLOG SERVICE
      *>================================================================
      *> REQ: COM-013
       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. ITMAUDIT.
       AUTHOR. K M PATEL.
       DATE-WRITTEN. 01/12/2009.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-PC.
       OBJECT-COMPUTER. IBM-PC.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       COPY AUDITLOGCA REPLACING ==DFHCOMMAREA== BY ==WS-AUDITLOG==.
       LINKAGE SECTION.
       COPY ITMAUDTW.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION USING ITA-BLOCK.
       0000-MAIN SECTION.
       0000-ENTRY.
           INITIALIZE WS-AUDITLOG
           MOVE "WRITE" TO CA-FUNCTION OF WS-AUDITLOG
           MOVE ITA-COMPANY TO CA-COMPANY OF WS-AUDITLOG
           MOVE ITA-USER TO CA-USER OF WS-AUDITLOG
           MOVE ITA-CORRELATION TO CA-CORRELATION-ID OF WS-AUDITLOG
           MOVE ITA-ENTITY-TYPE TO AU-ENTITY-TYPE
           MOVE ITA-ENTITY-KEY TO AU-ENTITY-KEY
           MOVE ITA-ACTION TO AU-ACTION
           MOVE ITA-FIELD-NAME TO AU-FIELD-NAME
           MOVE ITA-OLD-VALUE TO AU-OLD-VALUE
           MOVE ITA-NEW-VALUE TO AU-NEW-VALUE
           MOVE ITA-REASON TO AU-REASON
           MOVE ITA-AUTHORITY-REF TO AU-AUTHORITY-REF
           MOVE "COBOL" TO AU-SOURCE
           MOVE "N" TO AU-SENSITIVE
           CALL "AUDITLOG" USING WS-AUDITLOG
           MOVE CA-RETURN-CODE OF WS-AUDITLOG TO ITA-RC
           MOVE CA-MESSAGE OF WS-AUDITLOG TO ITA-MSG.
       0000-EXIT.
           GOBACK.
